// Project Nyra Oracle VPS Tailscale Services approval snippet.
//
// The oracle-vps node is tagged `tag:prod`. These auto-approvers let that
// node advertise the browser-useful svc:* endpoints configured by:
//   infra/hosts/oracle-vps/scripts/configure-tailscale-services.sh
